{"id":"2e365ef412503e95","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-thm-kuenneth.md","title":"Künneth Theorem","display":"thm-kuenneth — Künneth Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-kuenneth","aliases":["58-thm-kuenneth"],"display":"thm-kuenneth — Künneth Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-tensor]]","[[58-df-tor]]","[[58-df-homology]]","[[58-df-short-exact]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-kuenneth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-kuenneth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kuenneth — Künneth Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9bf75150bce95ccc\" href=\"?note=9bf75150bce95ccc\" title=\"58-df-tensor\">58-df-tensor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"626a376aca69b0c2\" href=\"?note=626a376aca69b0c2\" title=\"58-df-tor\">58-df-tor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9f6d19a1e737076\" href=\"?note=d9f6d19a1e737076\" title=\"58-df-homology\">58-df-homology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"10e6ac165c352cd8\" href=\"?note=10e6ac165c352cd8\" title=\"58-df-short-exact\">58-df-short-exact</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,X,Y,i_n,\\pi_n\\in V\">\\(R,X,Y,i_n,\\pi_n\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PID}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{PID}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_n(-;R)\">\\(H_n(-;R)\\)</span> is singular homology with coefficients in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tor}_1^R\">\\(\\operatorname{Tor}_1^R\\)</span> is the derived tensor functor</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kuenneth} \\vdash \\operatorname{PID}(R)\\to\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists i_n,\\pi_n\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S\\!\\left(\\bigoplus_{p+q=n}H_p(X;R)\\otimes_R H_q(Y;R),H_n(X\\times Y;R),\\bigoplus_{p+q=n-1}\\operatorname{Tor}_1^R(H_p(X;R),H_q(Y;R)),i_n,\\pi_n,R\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kuenneth} \\vdash \\operatorname{PID}(R)\\to\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists i_n,\\pi_n\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S\\!\\left(\\bigoplus_{p+q=n}H_p(X;R)\\otimes_R H_q(Y;R),H_n(X\\times Y;R),\\bigoplus_{p+q=n-1}\\operatorname{Tor}_1^R(H_p(X;R),H_q(Y;R)),i_n,\\pi_n,R\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This homological Künneth sequence is natural and splits noncanonically under the stated PID hypotheses.</li>\n<li>Over a field the Tor term vanishes, giving the familiar direct tensor-product formula.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-tensor","status":"resolved","id":"9bf75150bce95ccc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tensor]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tor","status":"resolved","id":"626a376aca69b0c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tor]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homology","status":"resolved","id":"d9f6d19a1e737076","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-homology]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-short-exact","status":"resolved","id":"10e6ac165c352cd8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-short-exact]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,X,Y,i_n,\\pi_n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PID}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"H_n(-;R)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tor}_1^R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kuenneth} \\vdash \\operatorname{PID}(R)\\to\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists i_n,\\pi_n\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S\\!\\left(\\bigoplus_{p+q=n}H_p(X;R)\\otimes_R H_q(Y;R),H_n(X\\times Y;R),\\bigoplus_{p+q=n-1}\\operatorname{Tor}_1^R(H_p(X;R),H_q(Y;R)),i_n,\\pi_n,R\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1068,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4261","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-thm-kuenneth.md|58-thm-kuenneth]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["9bf75150bce95ccc","626a376aca69b0c2","d9f6d19a1e737076","10e6ac165c352cd8"]}